!CHECK 231223.40 | 000120 | line 37 CF,80
!CHECK 231224.00 | 231366.00+ | line 38 VF,YUCBF1
!CHECK 231224.40 | 231225.77 01 | line 39 LVI,$15,$+1.0
!CHECK 231225.00 | 230672.04 00 | line 40 BD,SBRK8
!CHECK 231225.40 | 231366.66+ | line 41 VF,YUCBF1+.54
!CHECK 231226.00 | 000065 | line 42 CF,53.
!CHECK 231226.40 | 231376.00+ | line 43 VF,YUCBF2
!CHECK 231227.00 | 000001.00+ | line 44 YUSB8C VF,1.
!CHECK 231227.40 | 000001.33 01 | line 45 LVI,$13,1.0
